<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Patients | The Helper Hospital</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styling.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include("_header.ejs") %>

    <main class="main-shell patient-page-shell">
        <section class="section-header reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow">Patient services</p>
            <h1>Support from admission to recovery</h1>
            <p>We provide a welcoming environment where every patient receives respectful, coordinated, and safe care throughout treatment.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="content-panel reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow">Quality care and facilities</p>
            <h2>Everything in place for better treatment outcomes.</h2>
            <p>Our hospital combines skilled healthcare teams, reliable facilities, and coordinated services to give patients the best possible treatment experience from their first consultation through recovery.</p>

            <div class="feature-grid">
                <article class="feature-card">
                    <div class="icon">01</div>
                    <h3>Coordinated clinical care</h3>
                    <p>Doctors, nurses, and support teams work together to create clear treatment plans and keep every stage of care connected.</p>
                </article>

                <article class="feature-card">
                    <div class="icon">02</div>
                    <h3>Modern diagnostic facilities</h3>
                    <p>Diagnostic and imaging services help our clinicians make informed decisions and begin the right treatment as quickly as possible.</p>
                </article>

                <article class="feature-card">
                    <div class="icon">03</div>
                    <h3>Safe recovery support</h3>
                    <p>Comfortable treatment spaces, attentive monitoring, and follow-up guidance help patients recover safely and confidently.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        
    
            
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include("_footer.ejs") %>
    <script src="/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
